'''Dark Wind''' ((風 (黒) ''Kaze (Kuro)'', '''Wind (Black)''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Dark Wind
|image = E 582.png
|appearance = [[JRA Collaboration Event]]<br>
[[Heartbeat Catcademy#List of Stages|Weekend: Confession]]<br>
[[Monthly Event All-Stars Grateful Gathering]]
|money drop = 250¢ - 987¢
}}

==Enemy==
Much like the other two, Dark Wind has nearly identical stats, only having higher attack power, movement speed, 10 knockbacks, no special ability and the Dark trait.

==Strategy==
Dark Wind is the toughest of the three winds, but not by much. Once again due to the limited unit selection in most of the stages it appears in, it's mostly down to how many plus levels your units have, especially with [[Catnip Dragon (Special Cat)|Catnip Dragon]] and [[Tomboy Lion Cat (Special Cat)|Tomboy Lion Cat]] due to their anti-Dark abilities.

